OL,3,AColman Domingo, Jason Segel and host
OL,4,AMariska Hargitay among stars arriving
OL,5,Aon red carpet at the Emmy Awards
OL,6,
OL,7,FLaw & Order star Mariska Hargitay is
OL,8,Fset to host TV's biggest night, the
OL,9,F78th Primetime Emmy Awards
OL,11,FStars from Zendaya and Nicole Kidman to
OL,12,FColman Domingo and Steve Carell are
OL,13,Fstrutting down the red carpet at the
OL,14,FPeacock Theater in Downtown Los Angeles
OL,15,F- the awards show kicks off at 17:00
OL,16,Flocal time (20:00 EDT/01:00 BST)
OL,18,FLeading the pack in nominations this
OL,19,Fyear is the medical drama The Pitt,
OL,20,Fwhich is up for 25 awards - read more
OL,21,Fabout the show here
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
